# Product Sense & User Experience Standards (Product Sense Document)

<product_sense version="1.0" framework="RIPER-5">

<!-- This file captures durable product judgment and user experience standards
     that AI coding agents cannot infer reliably from code alone.
     Every technical feature generated must align with the product invariants below. -->

